        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The missing cost is often not the management fee alone. It is everything around it: marketplace fees, payment costs, discounting, and day-to-day execution. Seascape's current benchmark shows an observed 13.4% Airbnb host-fee cost compared with an approximate 2.9% direct payment cost."
